{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108735","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108735/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108735/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108735/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108735","id":3241886316,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7BO0Js","number":108735,"title":"Shader built-in `VIEWPORT_SIZE` is affected by `scaling_3d_scale`","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-07-18T05:13:24Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T11:04:27Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4, 4.5\n\n### System information\n\nLinux\n\n### Issue description\n\nShader built-in `VIEWPORT_SIZE` is affected by `scaling_3d_scale`:\n```gdshader\nshader_type spatial;\n\nrender_mode cull_front, unshaded, depth_draw_never;\n\nuniform vec3 outline_color : source_color = vec3(0.2);\nuniform float outline_width : hint_range(0.0, 10.0, 0.001) = 4.0;\n\nvoid vertex() {\n\tvec4 clip_position = PROJECTION_MATRIX * MODELVIEW_MATRIX * vec4(VERTEX, 1.0);\n\tvec3 clip_normal = mat3(PROJECTION_MATRIX) * mat3(MODELVIEW_MATRIX) * NORMAL;\n\n\tclip_position.xy += normalize(clip_normal.xy) / VIEWPORT_SIZE * clip_position.w * outline_width;\n\tPOSITION = clip_position;\n}\n\nvoid fragment() {\n\tALBEDO = outline_color.rgb;\n}\n```\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b1f06db8-dfcf-419e-bf49-577811180855\n\nIf I hardcode the viewport size instead of using `VIEWPORT_SIZE`, the outline size will not be affected by `scaling_3d_scale`\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen the MRP and change `scaling_3d_scale`.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[shader-viewport-size.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21309785/shader-viewport-size.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108735/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108735/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}